      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF-07 Render, QC & Publishing Queue\nRenders the 720p preview (cached per-scene clips), runs QC and sends the preview with approval buttons. Final 1080p only after content approval; publishing only after publish approval (ALLOW_AUTO_PUBLISH=false → ready_manual).\n\nPOST /webhook/ass/wf07-render\nHeader: as configured in 'ASS Webhook Auth'\nBody: {\"episode_id\": 1, \"run\": \"r1\", \"chat_id\": 123}\n\nIdempotent: same episode_id+run → same job.",
        "height": 260,
        "width": 380
